<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/623023667%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Berlanga";
    rdfs:comment "Berlanga de Duero is a Spanish municipality located in the province of Soria, in the autonomous region of Castile and León. An object dubbed the \"Berlanga cup\" was discovered here. This object is a hemispherical bowl that belongs to a small group of artifacts referred to as \"Hadrian's Wall pans\", as these vessels depict places and names from sites along the line of Hadrian's Wall.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/623023667> .

