    rdfs:comment "Tell el-'Oueili is an archaeological site located in the Dhi Qar Governorate of southern Iraq. Occupation at the site predates the occupation levels of Eridu, making Tell el-'Oueili one of the earliest known human settlements of southern Mesopotamia.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/636257512> .

