<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/639008/osm-location-of-aarkikaraaaaass-modern> dcterms:contributor <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/thomase>;
    dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/nkaye>;
    dcterms:description "Modern town on the NE shore of the Beyşehir lake, which is thought to be close to or identical with the location of ancient Neapolis in the Killanion Pedion (Cillanian Plain). Several proposed candidates for the location of Neapolis are neighborhoods now within boundaries of the municipality Şarkikaraağaç, namely Fele = Yassıbel; Yukarı İznebolu and Kıyakdede.";
