    dcterms:description "Representative locations of the Neo-Assyrian archive at Imgur-Enlil on the basis of Pedersén 1987 Plan(s) 77–78.";
    dcterms:modified "2023-05-11T12:51:02-04:00";
    dcterms:subject "ANE",
