<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/674031361%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Gebel es-Silsilah";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/727172%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "A mountain on the west bank of the Nile River some 40 miles north of Aswan with over 30 Eighteenth Dynasty shrines. This site was first settled in the late Predynastic period, was an important sandstone quarry in the Eighteenth Dynasty with some inhabitants, and was still used in the Roman period.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/674031361> .

<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/674031361/kheny> dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/zrosalinsky>;
