<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/678393/sidunu-rabu> dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jnovotny>;
    dcterms:description "Ṣidūnu rabû (\"greater Sidon\") is mentioned with Ṣidūnu ṣehru (\"lesser Sidon\") in inscriptions of the Assyrian king Sennacherib (r. 704-681 BC). The name probably refers to an area of Sidon, perhaps the mainland portion or the central part of the city.";
