<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/684635473%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Wrestling Grounds of Cercyon (Attica)";
    rdfs:comment "Located between Megara and Eleusis, the Wrestling Grounds of Cercyon is said to be a place where Cercyon of Eleusis would wrestle strangers, often against their will, until he was eventually bested by Theseus. Pausanias describes the wrestling ground as being located near the tomb of Alope, Cercyon's daughter.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/684635473> .

