<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/687828%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Aphekou Pyrgos";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/802393070%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Now occupied by the ruins of a 19th-century fortified manor house built atop and with spolia from a Crusader-era fortress, this hill and environs were in antiquity the site of a fortified village destroyed by the Romans in the first century but subsequently repopulated. Today a national park, the area was formerly occupied by the Palestinian village of Majdal Yaba, which was depopulated in the 1940s.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/687828> .

