<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/699913%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "El-‘Iraq";
    rdfs:comment "At modern El-‘Iraq in Jordan's Karak region, archaeologists have identified Byzantine pottery, architecture (including a church), and inscriptions. They argue, based on the archaeology and on the relative placement of other contemporary settlements on the Madaba map, that this site should be identified as ancient Tharais.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/699913> .

