        "BAtlas 6 Ara Alexandri",
        "ItMiller 624, 837",
        "KU TP Database (Rathmann) 1951: Ara Alexandri",
        "Plin., NH (Mayhoff: PHI) 6.110.6",
        "Podossinov 2002 375-76",
