        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/thomase>;
    dcterms:description "At Campetti - Decumano, in the southwestern part of Veii near the \"Portonaccio\" gate, there is evidence for a sacred complex that includes a therapeutic bath dating to the Roman period. Some residential functions emerged in Late Antiquity.";
