<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/638801> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/vocab#Place>;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "BAtlas 65 B5 Chimaera",
        "GeoNames 322898: Avlan",
