<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/649638685%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Tırmıl Tepe Höyüğü";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/652350%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "An unexcavated mound on the outskirts of modern Mersin in Turkey. Archaeological surface survey yielded pottery dating from the Calcolithic to the Medieval periods. Atop the mound lie the much-depleted ruins of a possibly medieval fortification. Tırmıl Tepe Höyüğü numbers among the proposed locations of ancient Kundu/Kyinda.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/649638685> .

