        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/687838%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Azotos Paralios, also referred to as Ashdod-Yam, is a multi-period archaeological site located on the Mediterranean coast of Israel. It dates back to the time of the Assyrian Empire. The toponym \"Azotos Paralios\" belongs to its Hellenistic phase.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/687843> .

