    dcterms:creator <http://viaf.org/viaf/73868693/>;
    dcterms:description "Azotos Paralios, also referred to as Ashdod-Yam, is a multi-period archaeological site located on the Mediterranean coast of Israel. It dates back to the time of the Assyrian Empire. The toponym \"Azotos Paralios\" belongs to its Hellenistic phase.";
