    dcterms:coverage "Yümüktepe";
    dcterms:creator <http://viaf.org/viaf/91669326>;
    dcterms:description "A tell known today as \"Yumuktepe\" is located at modern Mersin in Turkey. Excavations there, beginning in the 20th century, have provided evidence for continuous and/or successive human settlement beginning in the Neolithic period. Scholars believe that the names \"Ingirâ\" (found in Akkadian sources) and \"Anchiale(ia)\" (found in Greco-Roman sources) are to be associated with the site.";
